---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {products} from '../data/catalog';import {projects} from '../data/projects';
---
<Base title="Made for the makers" description="ESP32 projects, practical build guides and curated maker hardware at MAKHEX."><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">THE NEXT GENERATION MAKER LAB</div><h1>Curiosity<br/>has <em>no limits<span class="lime">.</span></em></h1><p>Big ideas start with small boards. Explore ESP32 projects, find components, and build something real.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="/projects/" class="btn btn-lime">Explore projects ↗</a><a href="/hardware/" class="btn btn-ghost">Browse hardware →</a></div><div class="hero-micro"><div><strong>10<span>+</span></strong><small>STARTER BUILDS</small></div><div><strong>ESP<span>32</span></strong><small>PROTOTYPE POWER</small></div><div><strong>∞</strong><small>WAYS TO MAKE</small></div></div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-1"></div><div class="orbit orbit-2"></div><div class="board"><div class="pins left-pins">{Array.from({length:10},()=> <i></i>)}</div><div class="chip"><span class="chip-mark">M<span>+</span></span><small>MAKHEX LABS</small><b>ESP32-S3</b><div class="chip-stripes"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="pins right-pins">{Array.from({length:10},()=> <i></i>)}</div><div class="led"></div></div><span class="float-code code-1">GPIO_04 // HIGH</span><span class="float-code code-2">WIFI: CONNECTED ✓</span><span class="float-tag">IDEA → PROTOTYPE</span></div></div><div class="hero-bottom wrap"><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span><span>01 / INFINITE POSSIBILITIES</span></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / GET INSPIRED</div><h2>Pick a project.<br/><em>Make it yours.</em></h2></div><div class="section-aside"><p>From simple sensors to your next AI gadget. Start with a build idea.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">All 10 projects ↗</a></div></div><div class="feature-grid">{projects.slice(0,3).map((p,i)=><a class="feature-card" href={'/projects/'+p.slug+'/'}><div class={'feature-art art-'+i}><span class="feature-number">0{i+1}</span><span class="feature-badge">{p.label}</span><div class="art-shape shape-a"></div><div class="art-shape shape-b"></div></div><div class="feature-meta"><span>{p.level} · {p.time}</span><span>↗</span></div><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.intro}</p></a>)}</div></div></section><section class="manifesto"><div class="wrap manifesto-inner"><div class="eyebrow">WHAT WE BELIEVE</div><h2>Less scrolling.<br/><em>More soldering.</em></h2><p>Practical guidance, building blocks and a community of makers.</p><a href="/about/" class="btn btn-line">Meet MAKHEX ↗</a></div></section><section class="section section-hardware"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / GEAR UP</div><h2>Good hardware.<br/><em>Great possibilities.</em></h2></div><div class="section-aside"><p>Research-stage components. Exact suppliers and checkout links follow verification.</p><a href="/hardware/" class="text-link">Explore hardware ↗</a></div></div><div class="hardware-grid">{products.slice(0,4).map((p,i)=><a class="hardware-card" href={'/hardware/'+p.slug+'/'}><div class={'mini-board mini-'+i}><span class="mini-board-core">{p.kind.slice(0,3)}</span></div><span class="hardware-kind">{p.kind}</span><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.tag}</p><span class="link-arrow">View details ↗</span></a>)}</div></div></section><section class="closing"><div class="wrap closing-inner"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT PROJECT STARTS HERE</div><h2>Ready to make<br/><em>something real?</em></h2><a href="/projects/" class="btn btn-lime">Find your next build ↗</a></div></section></Base>